OL,3,GNEWSAPrimary school closes due to road
OL,4,Asafety concerns
OL,5,
OL,6,FA primary school was closed after the
OL,7,Fremoval of a zebra crossing sparked
OL,8,Froad safety concerns for pupils.
OL,10,FGovernors at Lakenheath Community
OL,11,FPrimary School said there had already
OL,12,Fbeen "several near-miss incidents"
OL,13,Foutside its gates prior to the
OL,14,Fdecision.
OL,16,FHowever, after discussions with Suffolk
OL,17,FCounty Council earlier, it said the
OL,18,Fsite would reopen on Wednesday.
OL,20,FA spokesperson for the Reform UK-led
OL,21,Fauthority said some of the highways
OL,22,Fissues had been "out of our control".
